<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine stock market closes for Labour Day.</title>
<headline>Philippine stock market closes for Labour Day.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>------------------------- May 1 --------------------------</p>
<p>	     * Trading resumes on Friday</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The Philippine stock market was closed on Thursday, a Labour Day holiday.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Friday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, the composite index plunged to new two-year lows, skidding by 2.23 percent, to 2,648.17.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8936, Fax 817-6267</p>
